---
description: Express backend rules
globs: apps/api/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/API.md, and AGENTS.md.
- Keep controllers thin; put business rules in services.
- Validate params, query, and body.
- Verify Supabase access tokens on protected routes.
- Check resource ownership and roles on every protected operation.
- Treat payment webhooks as untrusted until verified.
- Make checkout and webhook processing idempotent.
- Never trust prices, totals, roles, or payment statuses supplied by the client.
- Never return raw database errors or stack traces.
